  "issue": 368,
  "request": "Goal: Prevent duplicate provider invocations for identical AI agent prompts. Scope: Add a flow-local prompt hash cache at the Agent.call boundary using commandId, provider, profileKey, systemPrompt, userPrompt, jsonSchema, and fmtFallback. Cache only successful non-empty responses, expose cache hits through metrics or logs, and keep cached responses scoped to the active flow or spec-local artifacts. Out of Scope: No global cache and no cross-project or cross-flow reuse. Description: The implementation should return the saved response on a second identical call without invoking the provider. Different provider/profileKey or prompts must miss the cache, and failed or empty responses must not be cached.",
